      "better_line": "Cast Xathrid Necromancer using Nomad Outpost for {B} and the other two lands for generic mana, providing a 2/2 body and Human death-trigger synergy",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 52,
      "player": "Haiku4.5",
      "decision_index": 36,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With 4 mana available (3 Plains + 1 Island), Gem2.5Flash could have cast both Spirit Mantle (1W) and Curiosity (U) for 3 total mana, putting both on Ethercaste Knight. Spirit Mantle makes the Knight unblockable, so Curiosity would guarantee a card draw every time it deals combat damage. Casting only Spirit Mantle leaves Curiosity for a future turn unnecessarily.",
