      "action_taken": "Cast Xathrid Necromancer before playing a land drop for the turn.",
      "better_line": "Play Path of Ancestry (or Scoured Barrens for 1 life) first as it enters tapped, then cast Xathrid Necromancer using the three already-untapped lands (Nomad Outpost, Battlefield Forge, Exotic Orchard).",
