      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Haiku4.5 should play the Plains land first before casting Orzhov Signet. Playing the land drop is free and doesn't cost mana, while casting the Signet costs 2 mana. By playing Plains first, they have more mana available this turn and could potentially cast Ambition's Cost (3B) afterward if they have enough mana. With 7 lands + Plains = 8 lands, they could tap lands for the Signet (2 mana) and still have 6 mana remaining for Ambition's Cost. By not playing the land first, they're casting the Signet with current mana and then playing Plains tapped or untapped, potentially leaving less flexibility. The general principle is to play lands before casting spells to maximize available mana for the turn.",
