    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Haiku4.5 cast Sanctuary Blade before playing Unclaimed Territory as their land for the turn. Playing the land first would have given them access to additional mana, potentially allowing them to both cast the equipment and equip it in the same turn, or leave up more mana for other plays. Casting spells before making land drops is a common sequencing error that can cost tempo.",
