    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Haiku4.5 should play Unclaimed Territory before equipping, to ensure the land drop isn't missed. Playing lands before spending mana on other actions is fundamental sequencing. Additionally, equipping Sanctuary Blade for 3 mana to a creature when only Exotic Orchard is untapped (along with Heirloom Blade which is already on the battlefield) means they likely don't have enough mana - they have only 2 untapped lands (Exotic Orchard and possibly one other), making this equip potentially impossible or at least they should sequence the land first to have more mana available.",
