      "player": "Haiku4.5",
      "decision_index": 326,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Equipping Heirloom Blade to Riders of Gavony (3/3 → 6/4 with vigilance) instead of Garna, the Bloodflame (6/4 → 9/5). While Riders has vigilance which pairs decently with equipment, Garna is already the biggest creature and making it 9/5 creates a much more significant clock. With Haiku4.5 at 22 life, empty hand, and opponents at 34 and 37 life, maximizing damage output is important.",
