      "better_line": "Equip Heirloom Blade to Garna, the Bloodflame to maximize damage output with the 9/5 body, creating a faster clock against opponents with higher life totals",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 249,
      "player": "Haiku4.5",
      "decision_index": 326,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Heirloom Blade gives +3/+1 and has a death trigger that finds a creature sharing a type. Riders of Gavony is already 6/4 (likely buffed by Jirina Kudro or similar effects) and is the biggest threat on the board. Equipping it to become 9/5 would apply far more pressure. Knight of the White Orchid as a 5/3 is less impactful. Additionally, Riders of Gavony with vigilance can attack and still block, making it a better equipment carrier. The Heirloom Blade death trigger works with both (both are Human Knights), so that's not a differentiator.",
      "action_taken": "Equipped Heirloom Blade to Knight of the White Orchid (2/2 → 5/3)",
      "better_line": "Equip Heirloom Blade to Riders of Gavony (6/4 → 9/5) to maximize damage output on the largest creature with vigilance",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 249,
      "player": "Haiku4.5",
      "decision_index": 326,
    },
